\v 9 Kush's¦187102 sons were¦187103 Seva¦187103, Havilah¦187104, Savta¦187105, Raemah¦187106, and¦187107 Savteka¦187107. Raemah's¦187109 sons were¦187110 Sheva¦187110 and¦187111 Dedan¦187111.
\v 10 Then¦187114 Kush¦187114 fathered¦187115 Nimrod¦187118 \add and\add* he became a¦187122 mighty¦187122 \add warrior\add*.
