\v 17 Shem's¦187198 sons¦187197 were¦187199 Eylam¦187199, Ashur¦187200, Arpakshad¦187201, Lud¦187202, and¦187203 Aram¦187203. \add Aram's sons were\add*: Uts¦187204 \add !(Uz¦187204)\add*, Hul¦187205, Geter¦187206, and¦187207 Meshek¦187207.
