\v 43 These¦187464 are¦187465 the¦187465 kings¦187465 who¦187466 ruled¦187467 the region¦187468 of¦187469 Edom¦187469 \add (where Se'ir's descendants lived)\add* before¦187470 any kings¦187473 ruled¦187471 over Yisrael¦187475 \add !(Israel¦187475)\add*: Bela¦187476 son¦187477 of¦187477 Be'or¦187479, and¦187480 his¦187481 city's¦187481 name¦187480 was¦187482 Dinhavah¦187482.
