\v 50 When¦187546 Ba'al¦187547-Hanan¦187548 died¦187546, Hadad¦187551 \add ≈replaced him as king\add*. His¦187553 city's¦187553 name was¦187554 Paeu¦187554. His¦187556 wife's¦187556 name was¦187557 Meheytavel¦187557—she was the¦187558 daughter¦187558 of¦187558 Matred¦187560 \add ≈and the¦187561 granddaughter\add* of¦187561 Mey¦187562-Zahav¦187563.
