\v 1 These¦187602 were¦187603 Yisrael's¦187604 \add !(Israel¦187604)\add* sons¦187603: Re'uven¦187605, Shim'on¦187606 \add !(Simeon¦187606)\add*, Levi¦187607, and¦187608 Yehudah¦187608 \add !(Judah¦187608)\add*, Yisakar¦187609 \add !(Issachar¦187609)\add*, and¦187610 Zevulun¦187610,
