\v 1 Re'uven¦189119 was the¦189120 first¦189120 \add child\add* born to Yisrael¦189122 \add !(Israel¦189122)\add* \add (also known as Ya'akov\add* \add !(Jacob)\add* \add )\add*, but¦189126 when¦189126 he¦189126 \add ≈had sex with one of¦189127 his¦189128 father's¦189128 slave-wives\add*, his birthright was¦189129 given¦189129 to¦189131 the¦189131 sons¦189131 of¦189131 Yosef¦189132 \add !(Joseph¦189132)\add*, \add ≈another one of¦189133 Yisrael's¦189135 sons\add*. \add ≈So¦189136 Re'uven wasn't recorded as inheriting\add* the birthright¦189138,
