\v 10 (In¦189231 the¦189231 days¦189231 of¦189231 \add King\add* Sha'ul¦189232 \add !(Saul¦189232)\add*, they'd¦189233 battled with¦189235 the¦189237 Hagrim¦189237 and¦189238 \add ≈defeated them, so then\add* they'd¦189240 lived¦189240 in¦189241 their¦189241 tents¦189241 all¦189244 over \add ≈eastern¦189247\add* Gilead¦189248.)
