\p
\v 25 \add ≈But¦189474\add* they¦189474 disobeyed their¦189476 ancestors'¦189476 god, and¦189477 they¦189477 prostituted¦189477 themselves to the¦189479 gods¦189479 of¦189479 the¦189480 peoples¦189480 that¦189483 God¦189486 had¦189485 destroyed¦189485 \add ≈ahead¦189487 of¦189487 them¦189487\add* in that region¦189482.
