\v 69 Ayalon¦190416, and Gat¦190422-Rimon¦190424.
\v 70 ⇔Kohat's¦190449 other descendants¦190447 received \add the cities of\add* Aner¦190436 and Bil'am¦190442 \add !(Balaam¦190442)\add* and the nearby pastureland from the half-tribe of Menasheh¦190433 \add (that lives west of the Yarden River)\add*.
\p
\v 71 Gereshon's descendants¦190454 also received, from¦190456 the¦190456 part of¦190456 the¦190457 Menasheh¦190459 tribe¦190458 \add that lived across the Yarden River\add*, \add two cities\add* and pastureland near them: Golan¦190462 in¦190463 the Bashan¦190463 \add region\add*, and Ashtarot¦190469.
