\v 74 From¦190507 the¦190507 Asher¦190508 tribe¦190507 \add they received these cities and\add* their nearby pastureland: Mashal¦190511, Avdon¦190517,
\v 75 Hukok¦190525, and Rehov¦190531.
\p
\v 76 From¦190537 the¦190537 Naftali¦190538 \add !(Naphtali¦190538)\add* tribe¦190537 \add they received these cities and\add* their nearby pastureland: Kedesh¦190541 (in¦190542 the Galil¦190542 \add region\add*), Hamon¦190548, and Kiryatayim¦190554.
