\v 3 “My¦196720 master¦196720, the¦196721 king¦196721, may Yahweh¦196711 \add ≈multiply his people¦196714 one hundred¦196717 times¦196718 over\add*. Aren't¦196719 they all¦196722 \add *your\add* servants¦196724?” Yoav¦196709 \add diplomatically\add* \add ≈queried\add*, “\add So\add* why does¦196726 my¦196728 master¦196728 \add ≈want¦196726 to¦196729 do\add* this¦196727? Why should \add ≈he bring judgement on\add* Yisrael¦196732?”
