\v 6 \add ≈However,\add* \add @Yoav\add* had \add intentionally\add* not¦196783 counted¦196784 \add the tribes of\add* Levi¦196781 and¦196782 Benyamin¦196782, because¦196786 \add *he\add* was¦196788 horrified by the¦196791 king's¦196791 command.
\s2 Punishment for the census
