\p
\v 7 God \add ≈was¦196796 displeased¦196796 by what David had ordered, and¦196803 he¦196803 punished\add* Yisrael¦196806 \add !(Israel¦196806)\add*,
\v 8 and¦196809 David¦196810 said¦196809 to¦196811 God, “I've¦196814 \add ≈disobeyed¦196814 you badly by doing¦196817 that¦196821\add*. Please¦196825 \add ≈forgive your¦196829 servant¦196829 for his disobedience\add*, because¦196830 I've¦196831 \add ≈been very¦196832 stupid\add*.”
