\v 9 Then¦196835 Yahweh¦196836 told¦196835 David's¦196841 prophet¦196840 Gad¦196839,
\v 10 “Go¦196844 and¦196845 tell¦196845 David¦196848 that Yahweh¦196852 says¦196851 this: \add ≈I'll¦196854 give you¦196856 three¦196853 options—choose¦196857 one¦196860 of¦196861 them¦196861 and¦196862 that's what I'll¦196862\add* do¦196862 to¦196864 you¦196864.”
