\v 13 “\add Oh,\add* that's very distressing¦196929,” David¦196925 \add ≈replied¦196924\add* to¦196926 Gad¦196928, “but please¦196935 don't¦196947 let¦196933 me¦196933 fall¦196933 into¦196936 \add ≈my enemies'\add* hands¦196936. Yahweh¦196938 \add ≈is¦196941 very¦196943 merciful, so¦196944 please let him be the one to punish me¦196949 directly\add*.”
