\v 24 “No¦197173, I'll most definitely pay¦197190 the full¦197179 price¦197178,” King¦197170 David¦197171 \add ≈responded¦197169\add*. “I couldn't offer¦197188 a¦197189 burnt¦197189 offering¦197189 to Yahweh¦197187 \add ≈if it hadn't cost me anything\add*.”
