\v 26 and¦197202 \add *he\add* built¦197202 an¦197205 altar¦197205 to¦197206 Yahweh¦197206 there¦197203 and¦197207 offered burnt¦197208 offerings¦197208 and¦197209 peace¦197209 offerings¦197209 on it. He called¦197210 to¦197211 Yahweh¦197213, and¦197214 \add @Yahweh¦197214\add* answered¦197214 him¦197214 with fire¦197215 from¦197216 the¦197218 heavens¦197218 on¦197219 that altar¦197220 with the¦197221 burnt¦197221 offering¦197221.
