\v 29 \add ≈At¦197256 that time¦197256\add*, Yahweh's¦197248 \add ≈sacred¦197247 tent¦197247\add* that¦197249 Mosheh¦197252 \add !(Moses¦197252)\add* had¦197251 made¦197251 in¦197253 the wilderness¦197253, and¦197254 the¦197254 altar¦197254 for burnt¦197255 sacrifices¦197255, were¦197258 \add ≈on a hill used for worship near\add* Giveon¦197259 \add city\add*.
