\c 22
\p
\v 1 Then¦197277 David¦197278 said¦197277, “This¦197279 is¦197281 \add now\add* the¦197281 residence of¦197281 Yahweh¦197282 God, and¦197284 this¦197284 is¦197286 the¦197286 altar¦197286 for¦197287 Yisrael's¦197288 \add !(Israel¦197288)\add* burnt¦197287 \add #offering¦197287\add*.”
\s1 The preparation of standing up of temple
