\p
\v 1 \add ≈By then¦197644 David¦197644 was¦197645 old¦197645 and¦197646 coming to the end of his life\add*, and¦197648 he¦197648 made¦197648 his¦197652 son¦197652 Shelomoh¦197651 king¦197648 of¦197652 Yisrael¦197655 \add !(Israel¦197655)\add*.\x + \xo 23:1: \xt 1Ki 1:1-40.\x*
