\v 31 They, too, used \add ≈a process of¦198359 choosing randomly\add*, just like Aharon's¦198364 \add !(Aaron¦198364)\add* descendants¦198362 (their relatives¦198361), \add to determine their specific duties\add* irrespective of¦198361 where they came in their¦198361 families. This was done in¦198365 front¦198365 of¦198365 King¦198367 David¦198366, Tsadok¦198368 and¦198369 Ahimelek¦198369, the clan leaders, and the \add other\add* priests¦198372 and¦198373 Levites¦198373.
