\p
\v 1 These were the divisions¦198717 of¦198718 the gatekeepers¦198718:
\li1 From the¦198721 Korhim: Kore's son¦198721 Meshelemyah¦198720 (Kore¦198723 was one¦198724 of¦198724 Asaf's¦198727 sons¦198726),
\li1
