\v 3 Eylam¦198740, Yehohanan¦198742, and Elyehoeynay¦198744.
\li1
\v 4 Oved¦198747-Edom's\x + \xo 26:4-5: \xt 2Sam 6:11; 1Ch 13:14.\x* \add eight\add* sons¦198749 (in order): Shemayah¦198750, Yehozavad¦198752, Yoah¦198754, Sakar¦198756, Netanel¦198758,
\v 5 Amiyel¦198761, Yisakar¦198763 \add !(Issachar¦198763)\add*, and Pe'uletay¦198765. (God¦198769 had¦198768 blessed¦198768 him¦198768.)
