\v 7 Shemayah's¦198786 sons were¦198787: Otni¦198787, Refael¦198788, Oved¦198789, and Elzavad¦198790. His¦198791 relatives¦198791 Elihu¦198795 and¦198796 Semakyah were also capable men.
