\v 8 All¦198798 those¦198800 descendants¦198801 of¦198803 Oved¦198803-Edom¦198804 and¦198806 their sons and¦198807 relatives¦198807 were¦198808 capable \add #people¦198808\add* and \add ≈strong¦198811\add* workers. Altogether there were 62 of them.
