\v 20 The¦198945 Levite¦198945 Ahiyah¦198946 was¦198947 \add ≈in charge of¦198949\add* the¦198950 temple¦198950 treasuries, as well as the¦198952 storehouses¦198952 for dedicated¦198953 gifts.
\v 21 Laedan's descendants¦198955 (\add also\add* descendants¦198957 of¦198957 Gereshon) \add ≈were¦198964 leaders among their family groups. Yehiel¦198964 was a descendant of this Laedan\add*.
\v 22 Yehiel's sons¦198966 were Zetam¦198968 and¦198969 Yoel¦198969 \add !(Joel¦198969)\add*, \add and they\add* \add ≈were¦198971 in charge of\add* the¦198973 storehouses¦198973 in Yahweh's¦198975 temple¦198974.
