\v 16 and¦200019 the¦200021 gold¦200021 for¦200023 the¦200023 display tables¦200023, and the silver¦200027 for¦200028 the silver tables.
\v 17 \add ≈Also¦200031\add* the¦200031 pure¦200035 gold meat forks¦200031 and the¦200033 jugs¦200033 and basins, and the¦200036 weights of¦200036 the¦200037 gold¦200037 and silver¦200042 bowls.
\v 18 Then¦200047 the¦200047 weight¦200051 of¦200047 refined¦200050 gold for the¦200048 incense¦200048 altar¦200047, and¦200052 for making the winged creatures that¦200056 spread¦200056 out¦200056 across¦200058 the¦200060 top of¦200060 the¦200061 box¦200060 \add ≈containing\add* Yahweh's¦200063 agreement¦200061.
\v 19 \add He said\add*, “I've written¦200066 down all¦200071 those plans \add ≈following Yahweh's¦200068 direction, as he¦200070 gave me¦200069 instructions for what has to be done\add*.”
\v 20 Then¦200076 David¦200077 told¦200076 his¦200079 son¦200079 Shelomoh¦200078, “Be¦200080 strong¦200080 and¦200081 courageous¦200081, and¦200082 \add ≈get going\add*. Don't¦200083 be¦200085 afraid¦200085 or discouraged¦200088, because¦200089 Yahweh¦200090 God, my¦200092 god, is¦200093 with¦200093 you¦200093. He¦200095 won't leave you¦200095 and¦200096 he¦200097 won't abandon¦200097 you¦200097 before all¦200101 the¦200103 work¦200103 of¦200103 \add ≈constructing\add* Yahweh's¦200107 residence \add ≈and the necessary equipment\add* is finished¦200100.
\v 21 Listen¦200109, the¦200110 divisions¦200110 of¦200110 the¦200111 priests¦200111 and¦200112 the¦200112 Levites¦200112 for all¦200113 the¦200115 work¦200115 in God's house¦200116, and all the \add ≈skilled¦200125 workmen, will¦200118 be¦200118 backing you¦200118 in¦200119 all¦200119 the¦200121 work¦200121\add*. The¦200129 officials¦200129 and¦200130 all¦200130 the¦200132 people¦200132 are \add ≈ready to¦200133 follow your¦200135 instructions\add*.”
\c 29
